OL,3,GNEWSAKiller driver jailed for reversing
OL,4,Aover man twice                         
OL,6,FA driver who deliberately reversed over
OL,7,Fa man twice in Birmingham city centre  
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for life for his       
OL,9,Fmurder.                                
OL,11,FMomodou Johm, 39, drove over Adis      
OL,12,FChala, 27, before fleeing the scene in 
OL,13,Fthe early hours of 20 April.           
OL,15,FJohm, of Lodge Causeway, Bristol, was  
OL,16,Fsentenced at Birmingham Crown Court on 
OL,17,FFriday to life imprisonment with a     
OL,18,Fminimum term of 18 years. A jury found 
OL,19,Fhim guilty of murder last week.        
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
