OL,3,GNEWSAKiller driver jailed for reversing
OL,4,Aover man twice                         
OL,6,FChala had been out with friends when a 
OL,7,Fwhite BMW driven by Johm clipped his   
OL,8,Fleg in Mott Street. He banged his hands
OL,9,Fon the driver's door before Johm       
OL,10,Freversed into him, knocking him to the 
OL,11,Fground.                                
